prompt:
Handle this issue report end to end with the issue-fixer workflow (issue-orchestrator skill, if installed in the workspace): triage the evidence, locate the fault to file:line, confirm the plan with the human before editing (Gate 1), fix on an isolated branch cut from origin/{{config.baseBranch}}, run the repo's narrowest verification, open a draft PR, then report the result back into this conversation.

